  "operationRules": {
    "verify-work": "Checking does not authorize source repair. Explicit ledger or test/fuzz-target authoring is a distinct authorized artifact/test operation. A separate implementer writes tests; a fresh verifier judges resulting evidence. Production repair goes through implement-change.",
    "design-change": "Prototype requests give an implementer explicit disposable paths and experiments; designer stays read-only. Record findings, return to design, and preserve unrelated work.",
